 "entries": [
  {
   "text": "真是的……卡特琳娜你也说说——",
   "scene_id": "挖角的去向",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "你还知道这么多复杂的成语啊……",
   "scene_id": "喜悦",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "唉呀，原来是这么一回事。 没想到能看见卡特琳娜少有的得意的笑容。",
   "scene_id": "喜悦",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "既然你在背后笑得这么开心， 不如坦诚点，把开心表现出来就好了嘛。",
   "scene_id": "喜悦",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "不用在意我们，继续睡就好了啊",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "嘴上这么说倒是吃得很香",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "是很恐怖呢。连我自己都这么觉得。",
   "scene_id": "心菜的舞台",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "呵呵，加油哦。",
   "scene_id": "会场之中",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "哦，是真正的即兴剧呢。 那我演丈夫。",
   "scene_id": "自由尝试",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "哈哈，开玩笑的啦。",
   "scene_id": "自由尝试",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "呵呵。 您喜欢就好。",
   "scene_id": "自由尝试",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "慢着、再加人就麻烦了……。",
   "scene_id": "内浦湾",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "那还真是感谢你们的厚爱。不过，既然要参加试镜， 我和心菜自然会使出全力取得角色。",
   "scene_id": "接下来的舞台是",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "呼噜—……呼噜—…… 心菜你呀，就是因为吃这么多才会~……",
   "scene_id": "位于决心前方的是",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "心菜，太在意这种事会吃亏的。",
   "scene_id": "走吧，升起下个帷幕",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "……心菜先说吧",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "不过最后成为大明星的是八惠哦。",
   "scene_id": "群星的足迹",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "是啊。虽然流石她说…… 要让身为新人的静香跑腿，这样的话。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "哈？ 这氛围......啥情况......。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "话说，你俩是不是靠得太近了？",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "……我们刚才是在讨论什么话题？",
   "scene_id": "接下来的舞台是",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "难道是想加入吗？",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "喂，别这么懒散呀。",
   "scene_id": "寻找星星的季节",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "一针见血。 而且最后又被提了好多建议。",
   "scene_id": "请为我画一只羊",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "虽说是为了犒劳身为主演的我们， 不过突然告诉我们下周放假也很头疼啊。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "在旅馆会说我打扰了吗？",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "让我们一大早就来海水浴场……是怎么回事呢。 她本人好像不在欸……",
   "scene_id": "跃进的第一步",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "即时吐槽"
  },
  {
   "text": "因为小八惠是特别的呀。",
   "scene_id": "寻找星星的季节",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "和八惠天使般可爱的克里斯汀 完全不是一个风格呢。",
   "scene_id": "请为我画一只羊",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "哎呀？老师不是说可以自由发挥吗？",
   "scene_id": "自由尝试",
   "reaction_texture": "light_tease",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "玩笑·玩心"
  },
  {
   "text": "天使......。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "是你啊，卡特琳娜……！",
   "scene_id": "力所能及的事",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "我觉得要是让卡特琳娜多想就不好啦！",
   "scene_id": "位于决心前方的是",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "……！好的！ 非常感谢！",
   "scene_id": "心菜，烦恼中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "对不起，我还想再练习一会儿……",
   "scene_id": "心菜，烦恼中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "嗯，一会儿见。",
   "scene_id": "心菜，烦恼中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "不对！是我——",
   "scene_id": "落泪",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "不、不一定都是为我来的吧",
   "scene_id": "如今我站在这里",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "被夸奖时的反应"
  },
  {
   "text": "那是因为我——",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "感觉没到那么夸张的程度……",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "被夸奖时的反应"
  },
  {
   "text": "竟然选这个……",
   "scene_id": "寻找星星的季节",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "因为，实在是有点不好意思……",
   "scene_id": "全新的梦想，二人的约定",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "犹豫·脆弱"
  },
  {
   "text": "魅影…………！",
   "scene_id": "交换吧",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "啊。 只是觉得我们三个人的组合挺少见的……。",
   "scene_id": "研习会",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "这也正合我意。",
   "scene_id": "研习会",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "啊……。 这个……。",
   "scene_id": "会场之中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "没事没事。谢谢你能来看我们的演出。 今后也请继续支持天狼星。",
   "scene_id": "会场之中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "所以才会得意忘形吧。",
   "scene_id": "既是个性，也是演员",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "孤独的绝望与希望……",
   "scene_id": "默剧",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "……呼……呼……",
   "scene_id": "镜中互映的二人",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "非常感谢……！",
   "scene_id": "镜中互映的二人",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "……干嘛突然说这个。",
   "scene_id": "彼此交换的承诺",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "被夸奖时的反应"
  },
  {
   "text": "可是，我真的没想到事情会变成这样。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "犹豫·脆弱"
  },
  {
   "text": "你这么说的话…… 我知道了。我也很期待。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "……还以为是难得的两人独处旅行。",
   "scene_id": "内浦湾",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "……你觉得行的话、就行。",
   "scene_id": "内浦湾",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "是呢……嗯、如果有的话就再来吧。",
   "scene_id": "演员与海与少女们",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "……我才是、不好意思。",
   "scene_id": "演员与海与少女们",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "被夸奖时的反应"
  },
  {
   "text": "啊、没事。我们走吧。",
   "scene_id": "浪声",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "嗯。不会花太长时间的。",
   "scene_id": "浪声",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "可是，我觉得我现在与其说是在烦恼，不如说是在迷茫。",
   "scene_id": "第零步",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "啊哈哈，抱歉。 也许是看着海，不由得就想起了阿斯摩太吧。",
   "scene_id": "第零步",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "没有，我很开心。",
   "scene_id": "夜晚，光风霁月的舞台",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "被夸奖时的反应"
  },
  {
   "text": "……的确，未来的事情想再多也没有意义。",
   "scene_id": "夜晚，光风霁月的舞台",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "仿佛能感受到心菜的心意一般……",
   "scene_id": "一人二役・彩",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "呜……是、是吗。说起来，好像有说过要把它搬上舞台来着。",
   "scene_id": "全新的梦想，二人的约定",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "犹豫·脆弱"
  },
  {
   "text": "不愧是卡特莉娜，真熟练啊……。",
   "scene_id": "会场之中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "这样啊，谢谢支持。 卡特莉娜和流石在那边……。",
   "scene_id": "会场之中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "啊，老师来了。",
   "scene_id": "会场之中",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "但是……我是心菜的个性。是为了心菜而生的存在。 也是继承了她失去之物的存在。",
   "scene_id": "既是个性，也是演员",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "犹豫·脆弱"
  },
  {
   "text": "对呀。 走吧，心菜。回天狼星泡澡吧。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "收尾"
  },
  {
   "text": "……呐，心菜。",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 0,
   "scene_dependency": "medium",
   "behavior": "犹豫·脆弱"
  },
  {
   "text": "明明不是在宿生，为什么！？",
   "scene_id": "",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "我已经不懂你们在聊什么了……。",
   "scene_id": "新的开始",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "嗯？大家怎么了？",
   "scene_id": "在对手的身旁",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "难道这还不够吗……？",
   "scene_id": "走吧，升起下个帷幕",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "哎！？等、等一下！？",
   "scene_id": "落泪",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "反应性发言"
  },
  {
   "text": "……到这里为止，就是我的故事。 之后的事，大家也都知道了吧？",
   "scene_id": "全新的梦想，二人的约定",
   "reaction_texture": "immediate_reaction",
   "continuation_risk": 1,
   "scene_dependency": "low",
   "behavior": "收尾"
